The word underwent a pronunciation change due to the shifting of {{IPAchar-lite|/u/}} to {{IPAchar-lite|/i/}} after alveolar consonants.

Cognate with {{cog-lite|ja|sc=Jpan|水|tr=mizu}}, {{cog-lite|ojp|sc=Jpan|水|tr=mi<sub>1</sub>du}}.

